== Notes ==
* When ''bless'' is cast on crossbow [[bolt]]s, it adds a temporary [[blessed bolt]] item property (also known as "on-hit: slay rakshasa"), which will instantly kill any [[rakshasa]] hit by the bolts.
*The bonus to attack provided by this spell counts towards the +20 [[attack bonus cap]].
*This spell always targets the caster instead of the selected target. (A fix for this is available on the Vault<sup>[http://nwvault.ign.com/View.php?view=Scripts.Detail&id=3739]</sup>.)

